== Corkstown Pool schedule_changes "Drop-in schedule - swimming"
- IGNORED date-context "Monday, August 3"
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swimming"
- NOTICE "See Civic Holiday schedule."
    date text: "Monday, August 3"
    dates: 2026-08-03 Mon
    effects: see-schedule "Civic Holiday schedule"
    match: SCOPE_PHRASE
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swimming"

== Corkstown Pool special_hours
- NOTICE "The facility is closed until July 19."
    date text: "until July 19"
    dates: to 2026-07-19 Sun
    effects: closure
    match: SCOPE_PHRASE
    at: facility
- IGNORED heading "Civic Holiday"
    section: "Civic Holiday"
    at: facility
- NOTICE "Monday, August 3, noon to 5 pm"
    section: "Civic Holiday"
    date text: "Monday, August 3"
    dates: 2026-08-03 Mon
    time: "noon to 5 pm" 12:00-17:00 unchecked
    ambiguities: possible-activity-time
    at: facility
